invalid} · error(retry) · stale/offline (freshness chip + one-shot auto-refresh). i18n: every web key
present (addedOne/added/duplicate/maxReachedAnnounce/removed/removeTag/field-prompt/maxReached/
maxReachedHint/tagsNone/tagsList) + native leaf chrome — no English literals in Swift. a11y: chip remove
